@page "/about"
@layout MABamlai.Components.Layout.EmptyLayout

<PageTitle>About - MA Bamlai</PageTitle>

<div class="about-page">
    <div class="about-shell">
        <img class="team-logo" src="images/ma5951-logo.png" alt="Makers Assemble 5951 logo" />

        <h1>About MA Bamlai</h1>
        <p>
            Hi, I'm Alma. I’ve been part of the electronics team for two years now. Recently, we ran into a problem:
            we simply don’t know what we have, what we’re missing, or where anything is located.
            Last year, my team lead had an idea to create a website called "MA Bamlai" (What's in Stock). 
            The goal was to build a platform that manages our inventory—tracking what’s available, what’s out of stock,
            and where every item is stored. Ultimately, the project never got off the ground, so I thought this would be
            a great opportunity to take it on myself.
            The name comes from my robotics team, Makers Assemble #5951 (or MA for short).
            We have an inside joke in the team where we name our sites using Hebrew words that incorporate "MA"
            but write them in English. Since this site is meant to be useful (Bamlai = "in stock"), I decided to stick with the joke!
        </p>

        <div class="actions">
            <a href="/electronics" class="go-link">Go to Electronics</a>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
